{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":51,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["安慰耶路撒冷的話"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"你們這追求公義、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尋求耶和華的，當聽我言！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要追想被鑿而出的磐石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被挖而出的巖穴。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要追想你們的祖宗亞伯拉罕","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和生養你們的撒拉；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為亞伯拉罕獨自一人的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我選召他，賜福與他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他人數增多。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華已經安慰錫安","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和錫安一切的荒場，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使曠野像伊甸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使沙漠像耶和華的園囿；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在其中必有歡喜、快樂、感謝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和歌唱的聲音。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"我的百姓啊，要向我留心；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的國民哪，要向我側耳；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為訓誨必從我而出；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必堅定我的公理為萬民之光。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的公義臨近；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的救恩發出。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的膀臂要審判萬民；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"海島都要等候我，倚賴我的膀臂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要向天舉目，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"觀看下地；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為天必像煙雲消散，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地必如衣服漸漸舊了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其上的居民也要如此死亡","poem":1},{"noteId":52},{"text":"。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惟有我的救恩永遠長存；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的公義也不廢掉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"知道公義、將我訓誨存在心中的民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要聽我言！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要怕人的辱罵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不要因人的毀謗驚惶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為蛀蟲必咬他們，好像咬衣服；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蟲子必咬他們，如同咬羊絨。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惟有我的公義永遠長存，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的救恩直到萬代。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"耶和華的膀臂啊，興起！興起！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以能力為衣穿上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像古時的年日、上古的世代興起一樣。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從前砍碎拉哈伯、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刺透大魚的，不是你嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使海與深淵的水乾涸、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使海的深處變為贖民經過之路的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不是你嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華救贖的民必歸回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"歌唱來到錫安；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"永樂必歸到他們的頭上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必得着歡喜快樂；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"憂愁歎息盡都逃避。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"惟有我，是安慰你們的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是誰，竟怕那必死的人？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"怕那要變如草的世人？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻忘記鋪張諸天、立定地基、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"創造你的耶和華？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又因欺壓者圖謀毀滅要發的暴怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"整天害怕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其實那欺壓者的暴怒在哪裏呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被擄去的快得釋放，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必不死而下坑；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的食物也不致缺乏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是耶和華－你的上帝－","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攪動大海，使海中的波浪匉訇－","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華是我的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我將我的話傳給你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用我的手影遮蔽你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為要栽定諸天，立定地基，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又對錫安說：你是我的百姓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷苦難的終結"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"耶路撒冷啊，興起！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"興起！站起來！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你從耶和華手中喝了他忿怒之杯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喝了那使人東倒西歪的爵，以致喝盡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她所生育的諸子中，沒有一個引導她的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她所養大的諸子中，沒有一個攙扶她的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"荒涼、毀滅、饑荒、刀兵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這幾樣臨到你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰為你舉哀？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我如何能安慰你呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的眾子發昏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在各市口上躺臥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像黃羊在網羅之中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都滿了耶和華的忿怒","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"－你上帝的斥責。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，你這困苦卻非因酒而醉的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要聽我言。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的主耶和華－","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是為他百姓辨屈的上帝如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，我已將那使人東倒西歪的杯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是我忿怒的爵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從你手中接過來；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必不致再喝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"我必將這杯遞在苦待你的人手中；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們曾對你說：你屈身，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"由我們踐踏過去吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你便以背為地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像街市，任人經過。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":52,"caller":"-","text":"如此死亡：或譯像蠓蟲死亡","reference":{"chapter":51,"verse":6}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/51.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/52.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/50.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":23}